#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod pada halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan versi ini atau yang lebih baharu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"Open Plan users cannot submit session jobs. Workloads must be run in [job mode](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) or [batch mode](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"Pengguna Pelan Open tidak boleh menghantar kerja Session. Beban kerja mesti dijalankan dalam [mod kerja](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) atau [mod batch](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use sessions when you need dedicated and exclusive access to the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Session apabila anda memerlukan akses eksklusif dan khusus kepada QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use sessions {#set-up-to-use-sessions}"
msgstr "Persediaan untuk menggunakan Session {#set-up-to-use-sessions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before starting a session, you must [set up the IBM Quantum Compute client](/guides/install-qiskit-runtime) and initialize it as a service:\n"
msgstr "Sebelum memulakan Session, anda perlu [menyediakan klien IBM Quantum Compute](/guides/install-qiskit-runtime) dan memulakannya sebagai perkhidmatan:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open a session {#open-a-session}"
msgstr "Buka Session {#open-a-session}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can open a runtime session by using the context manager `with Session(...)` or by initializing the `Session`\n"
"class. When you start a session,  you must specify a QPU by passing a `backend` object. The session starts when its first job begins execution.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh membuka Session runtime dengan menggunakan pengurus konteks `with Session(...)` atau dengan memulakan kelas `Session`. Apabila anda memulakan Session, anda mesti menentukan QPU dengan menghantar objek `backend`. Session bermula apabila kerja pertamanya mula dilaksanakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you open a session but do not submit any jobs to it for 30 minutes, the session automatically closes.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Jika anda membuka Session tetapi tidak menghantar sebarang kerja kepadanya selama 30 minit, Session akan ditutup secara automatik.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Session class**\n"
msgstr "**Kelas Session**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"The following code block will return an error for users on the Open Plan because it uses sessions. Workloads on the Open Plan can run only in [job mode](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) or [batch mode](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Blok kod berikut akan mengembalikan ralat untuk pengguna Pelan Open kerana ia menggunakan Session. Beban kerja pada Pelan Open hanya boleh berjalan dalam [mod kerja](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) atau [mod batch](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Context manager**\n"
msgstr "**Pengurus konteks**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The context manager automatically opens and closes the session.\n"
msgstr "Pengurus konteks secara automatik membuka dan menutup Session.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"specify-length\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"specify-length\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session length {#session-length}"
msgstr "Tempoh Session {#session-length}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The maximum session time to live (TTL) determines how long a session can run.  You can set this value with the `max_time` parameter. This should exceed the longest job's execution time.\n"
msgstr "Masa hidup maksimum (TTL) Session menentukan berapa lama Session boleh berjalan. Anda boleh menetapkan nilai ini dengan parameter `max_time`. Ini hendaklah melebihi masa pelaksanaan kerja yang paling lama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This timer starts when the session starts.  When the value is reached, the session is closed.  Any jobs that are running will finish, but jobs still queued are failed.\n"
msgstr "Pemasa ini bermula apabila Session dimulakan. Apabila nilai dicapai, Session ditutup. Mana-mana kerja yang sedang berjalan akan selesai, tetapi kerja yang masih dalam giliran akan digagalkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is also an interactive time to live (interactive TTL) value that cannot be configured.  If no session jobs are queued within that window, the session is temporarily deactivated.\n"
msgstr "Terdapat juga nilai masa hidup interaktif (interactive TTL) yang tidak boleh dikonfigurasi. Jika tiada kerja Session dalam giliran dalam tempoh tersebut, Session akan dinyahaktifkan sementara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default values:\n"
msgstr "Nilai lalai:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Instance type (Open or Premium Plan) |  Interactive TTL | Maximum TTL |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Premium Plan | 60 sec* | 8 h* |\n"
"*\\* Certain Premium Plan instances might be configured to have a different value.*\n"
msgstr ""
"| Jenis instans (Pelan Open atau Premium) |  Interactive TTL | TTL Maksimum |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Pelan Premium | 60 saat* | 8 j* |\n"
"*\\* Sesetengah instans Pelan Premium mungkin dikonfigurasi dengan nilai yang berbeza.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To determine a session's max TTL or  interactive TTL, follow the instructions in [Determine session details](#session-details) and look for the `max_time`or `interactive_timeout` value, respectively.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menentukan max TTL atau interactive TTL Session, ikuti arahan dalam [Tentukan butiran Session](#session-details) dan cari nilai `max_time` atau `interactive_timeout`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"ends\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"ends\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "End a session {#end-a-session}"
msgstr "Tamatkan Session {#end-a-session}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A session ends in the following circumstances:\n"
msgstr "Session tamat dalam keadaan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The maximum timeout (TTL) value is reached, resulting in the cancellation of all queued jobs.\n"
msgstr "Nilai tamat masa maksimum (TTL) dicapai, menyebabkan pembatalan semua kerja dalam giliran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session is manually canceled, resulting in the cancellation of all queued jobs.\n"
msgstr "Session dibatalkan secara manual, menyebabkan pembatalan semua kerja dalam giliran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session is manually closed.  The session stops accepting new jobs but continues to run queued jobs with priority.\n"
msgstr "Session ditutup secara manual. Session berhenti menerima kerja baharu tetapi terus menjalankan kerja dalam giliran dengan keutamaan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you use Session as a context manager, that is,  `with Session()`, the session is automatically closed when the context ends (the same behavior as using `session.close()`).\n"
msgstr "Jika anda menggunakan Session sebagai pengurus konteks, iaitu `with Session()`, Session ditutup secara automatik apabila konteks berakhir (tingkah laku yang sama seperti menggunakan `session.close()`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"close\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"close\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Close a session {#close-a-session}"
msgstr "Tutup Session {#close-a-session}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A session automatically closes when it exits the context manager. When the session context manager is exited, the session is put into \"In progress, not accepting new jobs\" status. This means that the session finishes processing all running or queued jobs until the maximum timeout value is reached. After all jobs are completed, the session is immediately closed. This allows the scheduler to run the next job without waiting for the session interactive timeout, thereby reducing the average job queuing time. You cannot submit jobs to a closed session.\n"
msgstr "Session ditutup secara automatik apabila ia keluar dari pengurus konteks. Apabila pengurus konteks Session ditamatkan, Session diletakkan dalam status \"Sedang berjalan, tidak menerima kerja baharu\". Ini bermakna Session menyelesaikan semua kerja yang sedang berjalan atau dalam giliran sehingga nilai tamat masa maksimum dicapai. Selepas semua kerja selesai, Session ditutup dengan segera. Ini membolehkan penjadual menjalankan kerja seterusnya tanpa menunggu tamat masa interaktif Session, dengan itu mengurangkan purata masa beratur kerja. Anda tidak boleh menghantar kerja ke Session yang telah ditutup.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"If you are not using a context manager, manually close the session to avoid unwanted cost. You can close a session as soon as you are done submitting jobs to it. When a session is closed with `session.close()`, it no longer accepts new jobs, but the already submitted jobs will still run until completion and their results can be retrieved.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Jika anda tidak menggunakan pengurus konteks, tutup Session secara manual untuk mengelakkan kos yang tidak diingini. Anda boleh menutup Session sebaik sahaja anda selesai menghantar kerja kepadanya. Apabila Session ditutup dengan `session.close()`, ia tidak lagi menerima kerja baharu, tetapi kerja yang telah dihantar akan tetap berjalan hingga selesai dan keputusannya boleh diambil semula.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"session-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"session-status\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check session status {#check-session-status}"
msgstr "Semak status Session {#check-session-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can query a session's status to understand its current state by using  `session.status()` or by viewing the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) page.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menanya status Session untuk memahami keadaan semasanya dengan menggunakan `session.status()` atau dengan melihat halaman [Beban Kerja](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session status can be one of the following:\n"
msgstr "Status Session boleh menjadi salah satu daripada berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Pending`: The session has not started or has been deactivated. The next session job needs to wait in the queue like other jobs.\n"
msgstr "`Pending`: Session belum bermula atau telah dinyahaktifkan. Kerja Session seterusnya perlu menunggu dalam giliran seperti kerja lain.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`In progress, accepting new jobs`: The session is active and accepting new jobs.\n"
msgstr "`In progress, accepting new jobs`: Session aktif dan menerima kerja baharu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`In progress, not accepting new jobs`: The session is active but not accepting new jobs. Job submission to the session is rejected, but outstanding session jobs will run to completion. The session is automatically closed once all jobs finish.\n"
msgstr "`In progress, not accepting new jobs`: Session aktif tetapi tidak menerima kerja baharu. Penghantaran kerja ke Session ditolak, tetapi kerja Session yang belum selesai akan berjalan hingga tamat. Session ditutup secara automatik setelah semua kerja selesai.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Closed`: The session's maximum timeout value has been reached or the session was explicitly closed.\n"
msgstr "`Closed`: Nilai tamat masa maksimum Session telah dicapai atau Session telah ditutup secara eksplisit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"session-details\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"session-details\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Determine session details {#determine-session-details}"
msgstr "Tentukan butiran Session {#determine-session-details}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a comprehensive overview of a session's configuration and status, use the  `session.details() method`.\n"
msgstr "Untuk gambaran keseluruhan komprehensif konfigurasi dan status Session, gunakan `session.details() method`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage patterns {#usage-patterns}"
msgstr "Corak penggunaan {#usage-patterns}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sessions are especially useful for algorithms that require frequent communication between classical and quantum resources.\n"
msgstr "Session amat berguna untuk algoritma yang memerlukan komunikasi kerap antara sumber klasik dan kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Run an iterative workload that uses the classical SciPy optimizer to minimize a cost function. In this model, SciPy uses the output of the cost function to calculate its next input.\n"
msgstr "Contoh: Jalankan beban kerja berulang yang menggunakan pengoptimum SciPy klasik untuk meminimumkan fungsi kos. Dalam model ini, SciPy menggunakan output fungsi kos untuk mengira input seterusnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"two-vqe\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"two-vqe\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run two VQE algorithms in a session by using threading {#run-two-vqe-algorithms-in-a-session-by-using-threading}"
msgstr "Jalankan dua algoritma VQE dalam Session menggunakan threading {#run-two-vqe-algorithms-in-a-session-by-using-threading}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can get more out of a session by running multiple workloads simultaneously. The following example shows how you can run two VQE algorithms, each using a different classical optimizer, simultaneously inside a single session. Job tags are also used to differentiate jobs from each workload.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh memaksimumkan penggunaan Session dengan menjalankan berbilang beban kerja serentak. Contoh berikut menunjukkan cara anda boleh menjalankan dua algoritma VQE, masing-masing menggunakan pengoptimum klasik yang berbeza, serentak dalam satu Session. Tag kerja juga digunakan untuk membezakan kerja dari setiap beban kerja.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Try an example in the [Quantum approximate optimization algorithm (QAOA)](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm) tutorial.\n"
"  - Review the [Session API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/session) reference.\n"
"  - Understand the [Job limits](/guides/job-limits) when sending a job to an IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"  - Review [execution modes FAQs](/guides/execution-modes-faq).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  - Cuba contoh dalam tutorial [Algoritma pengoptimuman anggaran kuantum (QAOA)](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm).\n"
"  - Semak rujukan [Session API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/session).\n"
"  - Fahami [Had kerja](/guides/job-limits) apabila menghantar kerja ke QPU IBM&reg;.\n"
"  - Semak [Soalan lazim mod pelaksanaan.](/guides/execution-modes-faq)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
